@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+UC2 3.0.0-alpha.10 listing fixture generated with the native writer and CLI.
+Covers directories, spaces, CP850, literal glob characters, literal semicolon
+names and stored versions. The read-only helper requires Python 3 and uc2.
+Source and implementation tests: https://github.com/evvaletov/uc2
